"why_high_value": "New GB-InSAR family on a tailings crest (not DAS r4, not BOTDA r14, not FBG r13, not geodetic MEMS r02, not fluxgate r5, not MFL r27/r28, not CRNS r28). Lead REJECT of keep-pool on a recomputable LOS that a vendor piezometer dashboard would have cleared. Companion t2 is operational pool drop. sim_or_real=hil on a spare corner-cube.",